                <syl /><neume facs="#m-bbe97e21-70bc-4ddf-81aa-8fd695b00d27" type="punctum" xml:id="m-6322edd6-a15b-426f-9d68-23f651edf441">
                  <nc xml:id="m-85387388-93f3-4f37-ab12-b2795b4b5083" pname="b" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><custos xml:id="m-a240de25-870c-43bd-88c9-2f68c7b08e9d" facs="#m-d109ed6d-4238-484f-9539-2770f7601df2" pname="c" oct="4" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-b1a0994a-07c5-4c3f-8bbc-ab25d089a348">
            <lg xml:id="m-72367d38-f4ce-40d7-a731-154de8e688de">
              <l xml:id="m-ce28b277-f208-43fc-8203-87b040beee1c" facs="#m-c199aefd-093b-411e-8c1e-12bd129fed1c" label="ambiguous">April 30. — May I.</l><l xml:id="m-0892cc09-3a72-42ec-97df-bbaa216a8817" facs="#m-1b830f69-4a3a-42b4-9df7-e7d331541d42" label="ambiguous">1437</l><l xml:id="m-6d4ce3b9-9a31-48e7-9686-80e865f0e44a" facs="#m-dbbbd9a7-0115-4354-a4c6-80d269581248" label="text-like">St. Catherine of Sienna Virgin.</l><l xml:id="m-cd7b978c-1a5b-4b59-87df-c1868b2e03b3" facs="#m-9a260c3b-028b-46d9-a819-55e02094bf0f" label="ambiguous">30.</l><l xml:id="m-f734a678-a5ad-494e-9127-3eaab8121804" facs="#m-ecfe99db-c7ea-47e5-9723-e86ab3ebd1bc" label="ambiguous">Double.</l><l xml:id="m-f5d5967b-3a07-4973-8782-ca91449ba4ef" facs="#m-d9fd353b-50c7-4398-867d-8d2a8d3ebe91" label="lyrics-like">Mass. Dilexísti. p. 1225, except the following:</l><l xml:id="m-36c7ca21-d3f6-4018-ab42-1c9536441ce4" facs="#m-85495d29-bea4-4f16-aeca-17bb987e5968" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-2fe3b566-d77a-4cb7-934a-989d8ffa4e4f" facs="#m-4d940f38-8eab-40b1-b24c-9024d2a1a1d8" label="lyrics-like">A, quaésumus, omnípotens mus; * et ánnua solemnitáte laeté¬</l><l xml:id="m-62480709-666a-4866-a34e-63d935d5cc53" facs="#m-a7a04cdd-d04d-4e81-ad3d-0286f927725e" label="lyrics-like">I Deus: t ut, qui beátae Catha-Imur, et tantae virtútis proficiámus</l><l xml:id="m-346d2db5-b236-4459-8a98-383f9dd07c88" facs="#m-9a3c63c9-42e3-4e8e-a41c-01fa292dd902" label="lyrics-like">rinae Virginis tuae natalitia cóli-lexémplo. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-9ebc5029-87c1-452d-be98-b50c312af889" facs="#m-983c2c5b-16ac-441e-ba51-e014a057a8db" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-e77368ad-110d-49fa-9d08-a47a68b47855" facs="#m-b41ebaee-8b82-4ef1-93d8-df98b4b154ff" label="lyrics-like">H Scéndant ad te Dómine, quas in [ virgíneo fragrans odóre. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-fa31ca54-3bba-4d47-9276-ce5e7e4011f0" facs="#m-c8ed73a3-90b7-4488-bae7-bdea727d3616" label="lyrics-like">Il beâtae Catharinae solemnitáte minum.</l><l xml:id="m-84377f16-5af3-420e-ae37-e24f08d712bb" facs="#m-05b8cd42-1a96-42ae-aad5-96691297f042" label="lyrics-like">offérimus preces, et hóstia salutáris,</l><l xml:id="m-fbd9cae2-19da-4d66-a857-d87cef2ec8d5" facs="#m-48e82c6a-f78b-4e05-bee4-1f9ad6e4c7ef" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-e01c4609-4c4f-4c5d-b1d2-68df4e8b7b46" facs="#m-f9386899-cbb2-4e13-865a-ab040ad9ed7c" label="ambiguous">1</l><l xml:id="m-9ef46feb-20b6-4b23-a7fb-ad7e2801b853" facs="#m-30355dbf-0246-4422-ac3e-96c9a9832218" label="lyrics-like">Ternitátem nobis, Dómine, cón-l Virginis vitam étiam áluit tempo¬</l><l xml:id="m-819f39e3-4678-4ce2-9590-efc1ed6f1e40" facs="#m-c4b08a1d-b568-4b1f-90d4-39163908b126" label="lyrics-like">A ferat, qua pasti sumus, mensa rálem. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-93e62a0f-7a62-40ed-aac8-113eb46f63b2" facs="#m-42d49b3b-fbff-4739-9175-6c39d76f4931" label="lyrics-like">caeléstis: quae beâtae Catharínae!</l><l xml:id="m-6dc0d274-bfbb-4ec4-98f2-01ccb7b0adc4" facs="#m-806e2500-e87d-4791-9385-69b1f748dc01" label="ambiguous"> -- --  ~</l><l xml:id="m-c378cec1-e66c-4a62-bcfe-ae7dd7ac5181" facs="#m-bafdb8a4-81d8-4e14-b736-d68e0102f4b4" label="text-like">FEASTS OF MAY.</l><l xml:id="m-d5fb1a57-49ce-4e7d-b208-1d80243ba19d" facs="#m-c374a8a5-3120-4405-b406-2fc10e8391da" label="ambiguous">MAY 1.</l><l xml:id="m-0a69236d-6c4f-4c2c-8098-c90fb5f3bebc" facs="#m-0e102dcc-7722-4b89-9d52-bee78f93ca70" label="text-like">ST. JOSEPH THE WORKMAN.</l><l xml:id="m-8701efad-9493-4eeb-8f1a-66bda4e143d3" facs="#m-fda7ff9a-5882-4562-91f5-b8b60aecc2e7" label="text-like">Spouse of the B. V. Mary and Confessor.</l><l xml:id="m-c06e2018-3bc2-431e-b42c-6426ed9b8ad3" facs="#m-a26a62cb-fed5-4c62-ac25-fc6e18c36fa6" label="ambiguous">First Class.</l><l xml:id="m-288b8315-8572-4ba8-808d-9221139fedf4" facs="#m-b415defe-45d3-4c9c-8bf1-fd87a68d41c2" label="text-like">AT FIRST VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-5acd8fe5-0c75-4e1d-8e36-23cfeb652437" facs="#m-3816211d-8c9d-4290-956a-2bce2277646d" label="text-like">All as at second Vespers, p. 1446, except the follouing:</l><l xml:id="m-b405d08b-77b1-4c9c-aa76-05175766bd09" facs="#m-124e126a-ade5-43ca-8065-4eda5161efbd" label="lyrics-like">V. Solémni-tas est hódi-e sáncti Jó-seph, alle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-e5a05118-40de-4cad-af6c-cff68d6e31af" facs="#m-0dc5d527-e73c-4d70-b646-ab99d4260294" label="lyrics-like">R. Qui mánibus sú-is Fi-li-o Dé-i mi-nistrávit, alle-lú¬</l><l xml:id="m-2c18d299-c899-46da-ab13-8d5d44d967ae" facs="#m-6441f212-6c51-4ddf-8860-a3e480d7eee6" label="ambiguous">ia.</l><l xml:id="m-67126796-aea4-403e-b5c2-681208167a2e" facs="#m-515b1991-07d9-46a4-9398-6c856521fd2e" label="text-like">At Magnif.</l><l xml:id="m-71bb6f5e-6442-4f51-b537-c3c554e9b63f" facs="#m-47adeafb-8651-4ce9-afe7-75d62ad6a238" label="ambiguous">Ant. 7. 62</l><l xml:id="m-155c1f33-1c61-4252-97d4-582a89e0a1cd" facs="#m-f7be82fb-a12b-46ca-a588-0df39602b3e5" label="ambiguous">L</l><l xml:id="m-52df7784-3de9-4068-8490-7ee164a174e0" facs="#m-41db056e-3318-48bb-b624-0c0f4e420238" label="lyrics-like">Hristus Dóminus “ fábri fí-li- us pu-tá-ri digná¬</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>